	affiliations = {Neijiang Normal University, Neijiang, China},
	abstract = {Teaching is communication and exchange process between teachers and students. The quality of teaching depends on communication qualities, in special whether theories, ideas and methods are accurately transmitted from teachers to students. In programming course teaching, there are losses of original meaning of English textbook after translated into Chinese. In order to avoid the loss of original meaning, the author carries on using original English textbook for the software programming teaching. In the language choosing for specific documentation and programming descriptions, the author emphasizes the chosen of the technique inventor's language. With causality analysis in language and thinking, and induction method, the author proposed a new issue of Language Oriented Approach of Teaching Programming Skills, and give light to using AI to implement, such as emerged ChatGPT application. The author makes out the main points and structure of this approach, concludes the prerequisite for its use. Also the categories of Language Oriented Approach is mentioned. © 2025 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.},
